=== 7. the double eigenvalue at 37 ===
   eigenvalue +1 of 2K_37: eigenspace of dimension 2 (semisimple: det of the left-right pairing = 16/3 != 0);
      first-order splitting under R_e + (1 + eps) R_o: slopes d(2 lambda)/d(eps) are the roots of 40*x**2 + 71*x - 293 (discriminant 51921 = {3: 4, 641: 1})
   eigenvalue -1 of 2K_37: eigenspace of dimension 2 (semisimple: det of the left-right pairing = -80/3 != 0);
      first-order splitting under R_e + (1 + eps) R_o: slopes d(2 lambda)/d(eps) are the roots of 40*x**2 - 71*x - 293 (discriminant 51921 = {3: 4, 641: 1})
   so the two branches through (x, theta) = (1, 1) are conjugate over Q(sqrt(641)): one Q-rational node, not two independent rational coincidences.

